#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:133
msgid ""
"The cell area lies in the middle of all the rest. The cell area includes the"
" row and column labels, the scrollbars and the tabs below. The use of these "
"elements is explained in <xref linkend=\"cell-grid\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Cellområdet ligger mitt i arbetsytan. Det omfattar rad- och "
"kolumnrubrikerna, rullningslisterna och flikarna nedanför. Hur dessa delar "
"används beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"cell-grid\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:146
msgid ""
"This area is used by <application>Gnumeric</application> to give feedback on"
" the status of certain operations. This information is explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"info-area\"/>."
msgstr ""
"I det här området visar <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"statusinformation om vissa åtgärder. Informationen beskrivs i <xref "
"linkend=\"info-area\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:156
msgid ""
"The next chapters will explain each of these elements. <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"gui-menus\"/> will explain the menus, <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-toolbars\"/> "
"will explain the toolbars, <xref linkend=\"data-entry\"/> will explain the "
"data entry area, <xref linkend=\"cell-grid\"/> will explain the cell grid "
"area, and <xref linkend=\"info-area\"/> will explain the information area."
msgstr ""
"I de följande kapitlen går vi igenom varje del. I <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-"
"menus\"/> beskrivs menyerna, i <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-toolbars\"/> "
"verktygsfälten, i <xref linkend=\"data-entry\"/> dataregistreringsområdet, i"
" <xref linkend=\"cell-grid\"/> cellrutnätet och i <xref linkend=\"info-"
"area\"/> informationsområdet."

